## 2. COMPREHENSIVE MODULE ARCHITECTURE

### Module 1: Time-Windowed Asset & Inventory Vault
* **Conflict-Free Reservation Engine:**
  * Algorithmic reservation engine that calculates real-time asset availability against event dates, setup windows, transit buffers, post-event return inspection periods, and mandatory maintenance cooling-off intervals.
  * Real-time visual timeline and booking calendar preventing overlapping reservations, under-capacity commitments, or manual scheduling errors.
* **Categorized Multi-Tier Asset Registry:**
  * Dedicated asset profiles tracking serial numbers, purchase dates, manufacturer specs, maintenance history, and current operational states:
    * `AVAILABLE` (Ready for dispatch in warehouse)
    * `BOOKED` (Committed to an approved upcoming event)
    * `IN_TRANSIT` (En route to or from event location)
    * `ON_SITE` (Installed and active at client venue)
    * `MAINTENANCE` (Under service or routine testing)
    * `QUARANTINE` (Held pending damage inspection or customer dispute)
  * Specialized handling for high-capacity cooling systems, 5-ton to 10-ton package ACs, misting fans, power distribution units (PDU), industrial cables, and modular event structures.
* **Digital Warehouse Issue & Return Reconciliation:**
  * Digital Warehouse Issue Notes (WIN) generated automatically from approved bookings.
  * Barcode / QR-ready digital dispatch scanning verifying that every item leaving the loading bay matches the job manifest.
  * Mandatory post-event return inspection checklists with automatic variance calculation (identifying missing accessories, damaged ducting, or burnt cables before equipment is returned to stock).

---

### Module 2: Fleet Management & Logistics Desk
* **Vehicle Master Register & Compliance Guard:**
  * Centralized digital registry for all company delivery trucks, flatbeds, and logistical vans.
  * Automated compliance expiration alerts (Vehicle Inspection Service / Roadworthiness, Commercial Hackney Permit, Insurance, Heavy-Duty Permits) delivered to the Operations Director 30 days and 7 days prior to lapse.
* **Trip Sheets & Dispatch Control:**
  * Automated assignment of authorized drivers and field crews to approved delivery manifests.
  * Mandatory pre-trip odometer and fuel-level logging.
  * Real-time dispatch status tracking (`DISPATCHED`, `ARRIVED_AT_SITE`, `OFFLOADED`, `RETURN_TRANSIT`, `DEPOT_RETURNED`).
* **Maintenance & Repair Authorization Workflow:**
  * Structured driver/technician incident reporting for vehicle breakdowns, tyre wear, or mechanical issues.
  * Digital vendor quote upload and multi-tiered management approval workflow prior to repair authorization, preventing unauthorized fleet expenditure.

---

### Module 3: Event Operations & Site Delivery Engine
* **Digital Job Cards & Field Manifests:**
  * Complete operational job cards accessible via mobile PWA for on-site field supervisors.
  * Captures venue delivery access restrictions, generator power specifications, setup deadlines, client site contacts, and assigned technician rosters.
* **Pre-Dispatch & Setup Functional Checklists:**
  * Enforces mandatory pre-dispatch testing protocols—especially for high-capacity ACs and power generators (testing compressor drawdown, airflow temperature, oil levels, and voltage stabilization) before loading.
  * On-site commissioning checklist verifying that equipment is fully installed, balanced, and operational before client event commencement.
* **Mobile Customer Handover & On-Site Digital Signatures:**
  * Field supervisor captures on-site digital signature directly on smartphone/tablet from the event organizer or venue manager upon successful delivery and setup.
  * Instant generation and automated email/WhatsApp dispatch of the Delivery Handover Receipt, legally confirming equipment delivery in sound working condition.
  * Symmetric post-event collection sign-off documenting return condition and recording any missing or damaged items.

---

### Module 4: Incident, Loss & Security Audit Vault
* **Depot Gatehouse Security Control Desk:**
  * Dedicated tablet-optimized portal for depot gate security officers.
  * Digital Gate-Pass verification: Security cannot clear any truck or asset to exit the compound without a digitally verified Job Card and Dispatch Note generated by the warehouse.
  * Inbound vehicle inspection logging verifying return manifests at the perimeter gate.
* **Damage, Loss & Missing Items Registry:**
  * Mandatory high-resolution photo evidence capture directly within the mobile app for damaged equipment, torn marquee panels, crushed ducting, or severed power cables.
  * Immediate incident logging with automatic repair cost estimation and formal tagging of customer liability or internal technician responsibility.
* **Multi-Level Segregated Authorization Matrix:**
  * Granular approval thresholds for operational spend, emergency site expenses, equipment discounts, inventory write-offs, and maintenance disbursements:
    * Level 1: Field Supervisor (≤ ₦20,000 emergency expense)
    * Level 2: Operations / Warehouse Manager (≤ ₦100,000)
    * Level 3: Managing Director / COO (> ₦100,000 & all asset write-offs)

---

### Module 5: COO Executive Intelligence & Real-Time KPI Desk
* **Executive Operations Dashboard:**
  * Live KPI rollups tracking core operational metrics:
    * **Fleet Availability Rate** (Target: ≥ 95%)
    * **Inventory Accuracy & Reconciliation Rate** (Target: ≥ 98%)
    * **On-Time Site Setup Rate** (Target: ≥ 96%)
    * **Asset Utilization Index** (Revenue generated per cooling unit / generator per month)
* **Expenditure & Cost Center Tracking:**
  * Real-time aggregation of fuel costs per trip, fleet maintenance spend, third-party sub-rentals, and repair overhead against monthly operating budgets.
* **One-Click Audit & Export Engine:**
  * One-click PDF and Excel reporting for executive board meetings, monthly inventory valuation, and departmental accountability audits.

