## 3. PROPOSED TECH STACK & SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

| Component | Technology | Enterprise Rationale |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Frontend Application** | Next.js 15 (React 19, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript) | Blazing-fast progressive web application (PWA) optimized for mobile smartphones used by drivers, field crew, and warehouse staff. |
| **Backend API & Workflows** | Node.js (NestJS / Modular Architecture) | Enterprise-grade backend with strict transaction isolation, state machine controls, and cryptographically verified role permissions. |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (Relational Integrity) | Strict relational ACID transactions ensuring zero asset double-bookings and immutable inventory audit ledgers. |
| **Media & Photo Evidence Vault** | Cloudflare R2 Object Storage | Zero-egress fee private cloud storage for high-resolution damage photos, driver compliance documents, and vehicle inspection records. |
| **SMS & OTP Notifications** | Termii API Gateway | Instant transactional SMS and OTP delivery to Nigerian telecom networks (MTN, Airtel, Glo, 9mobile). |

